{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122021","id":4187120458,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc75kmNK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122021","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122021.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122021.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122021","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122021/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122021/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122021/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/dcb867de32395133ddf7be3f6e6aaed132abb4c1","number":122021,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix decreasing `ReflectionProbe`'s intensity property below `1.0` not reducing the strength of its ambient light condition in Forward+/Mobile","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes (partially) #121980 \r\n- It only fixes the first issue for Forward+/Mobile even tho the fix for Compat is same, Compat has some other issues as well. See [here](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/rendering/thread/o3qBcSMuf84ofZFmy)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe Forward+/Mobile shader never multiplies the ambient lighting contribution by `reflections.data[ref_index].intensity`. As a result, reducing a `ReflectionProbe`'s intensity below `1.0` only affects reflected light, while the ambient contribution remains unchanged. This PR applies the intensity multiplier to the ambient contribution as well.\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th align=\"center\">Before (Forward+/Mobile)</th>\r\n    <th align=\"center\">After (Forward+/Mobile)</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>\r\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1e32e14-32fc-440c-a1fc-1db092672d51\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Before View\" />\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td>\r\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07b92dc3-aa55-47c1-91ab-eb1c28cd9503\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"After View\" />\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n### AI Disclosure:\r\nThis PR doesn't use AI, it's all human written code & same goes for the desc 🙃\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"M